error[E0602]: a value of type Counter is not transferable, so it cannot be given to a spawned task
  --> $DIR/monitor-not-shareable.nra:21:20
   |
13 |     export let peek = func() -> int64 => count;
   |     ------ 'Counter' is not shareable: method 'peek' is exported and not synchronized
...
21 |         spawn work(counter);
   |                    ^^^^^^^ not transferable
   |
   = note: tasks may share an instance of a monitor: a class whose exported methods are all #Synchronized, whose fields are transferable, and whose state only its own methods reach through their receiver

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0602`.
